1d:T5aa,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"APK ijo dan APK hijau itu sama?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Ya, ijo hanyalah ejaan informal dari hijau. Keduanya adalah istilah slang yang sama dan sama-sama bukan nama aplikasi resmi. Penjelasan lengkap fenomenanya ada di panduan APK hijau kami."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Kenapa orang tidak menyebut nama aplikasinya langsung?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Biasanya karena nama aslinya akan terkena moderasi platform - konten judi, dewasa, dan bajakan dibatasi TikTok dan platform lain, jadi pembuat konten memakai kata kode berwarna. Justru karena itu, istilah berkode pantas dicurigai, bukan diikuti."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Apakah ada link download APK ijo yang resmi?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Tidak ada, karena tidak ada aplikasinya. Tautan apa pun yang mengklaim sebagai unduhan resmi APK ijo sedang menjual sesuatu yang tidak bisa dipertanggungjawabkan - berkas acak, aplikasi bajakan, atau jebakan iklan dan langganan."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Bagaimana cara tahu aplikasi hijau yang dimaksud itu resmi?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Cari nama aslinya di Play Store: aplikasi resmi punya halaman dengan nama developer yang jelas, riwayat pembaruan, dan ulasan publik. Bila satu-satunya jalan mendapatkannya adalah berkas dari situs berbagi, itu bukan jalur resmi."}}]}13:["$","article",null,{"className":"space-y-7 py-8","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Beranda\",\"item\":\"https://cekapk.com/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Panduan\",\"item\":\"https://cekapk.com/panduan\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Apa Itu APK Ijo? Arti Istilah Viral Ini dan Kenapa Harus Hati-Hati\",\"item\":\"https://cekapk.com/panduan/apa-itu-apk-ijo\"}]}"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$1d"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"Apa Itu APK Ijo? Arti Istilah Viral Ini dan Kenapa Harus Hati-Hati\",\"author\":{\"@id\":\"https://cekapk.com/#org\"},\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://cekapk.com/#org\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-10-18\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-10-18\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":\"https://cekapk.com/panduan/apa-itu-apk-ijo\",\"inLanguage\":\"id-ID\"}"}}],null,["$","nav",null,{"aria-label":"Breadcrumb","className":"text-sm text-ink/60","children":["$","ol",null,{"className":"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1","children":[["$","li","/",{"className":"flex items-center gap-1","children":[false,["$","$L5",null,{"href":"/","className":"hover:text-primary-dark","children":"Beranda"}]]}],["$","li","/panduan",{"className":"flex items-center gap-1","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":true,"children":"/"}],["$","$L5",null,{"href":"/panduan","className":"hover:text-primary-dark","children":"Panduan"}]]}],["$","li","/panduan/apa-itu-apk-ijo",{"className":"flex items-center gap-1","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":true,"children":"/"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-current":"page","className":"font-medium text-ink","children":"Apa Itu APK Ijo? Arti Istilah Viral Ini dan Kenapa Harus Hati-Hati"}]]}]]}]}],["$","header",null,{"children":[["$","h1",null,{"className":"text-[26px] font-extrabold leading-tight text-ink","children":"Apa Itu APK Ijo? Arti Istilah Viral Ini dan Kenapa Harus Hati-Hati"}],"$L1e"]}],["$L1f","$L20"],null,["$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24"],"$L25","$L26"]}]
